{"task_type": "Classification", "input": "Categorize the following animals: elephants, seals, jellyfish, lions.", "output": "Elephants and lions are terrestrial animals, while seals and jellyfish are marine species."}{"task_type": "Classification", "input": "Distinguish between the concepts of open ocean data and shared ocean data.", "output": "Ocean data opening refers to the public release of data for anyone to freely access and apply, while ocean data sharing refers to the standardized management and distribution of data, allowing users with demand to selectively obtain data."}
