{"task_type": "Question-Answering", "input": "Which metal elements are mainly contained in the polymetallic sulfides discovered in the Pacific Ocean basin?", "output": "The polymetallic sulfides in the Pacific Ocean basin primarily contain metal elements such as copper, zinc, lead, and nickel."}{"task_type": "Question-Answering", "input": "What is the main content of China's \"Marine Areas Use Management Law\"?", "output": "The main content of China's \"Marine Area Utilization Management Law\" includes the establishment of marine management zones, the use of marine property, the administration of marine resource utilization, protection of the marine ecosystem, prevention of marine environmental pollution, standardization of marine utilization practices, and the improvement of the marine management assurance system, among other things."}
