{"task_type": "Judgment", "input": "How should a dangerous situation encountered during the voyage of a certain ship be handled?", "output": "In case of emergencies during the operation of the ship, the crew members should take immediate necessary measures to ensure the safety of personnel and the ship. Measures such as changing the course, slowing down, signaling distress, and calling for rescue can be considered."}{"task_type": "Judgment", "input": "Are there islands in the sea area at the mouth of the Yangtze River?", "output": "Yes, there are numerous islands in the estuary of the Yangtze River, such as Chongming Island, Changxing Island, Hengsha Island, Dongpingzhou, and Nansizhou. These islands are distributed between Jiangsu, Shanghai, and Zhejiang Provinces and are important natural resources and tourist attractions in the East China Sea area."}
